{"4413480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prison Life Sim 2026 - Survival", "steam_appid": 4413480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the unforgiving world of Prison Life Sim 2026 - Survival, where every day is a struggle and every decision can change your fate. 🔒<br><br>Behind bars, rules are strict, danger is constant, and trust is rare. You’ll need to adapt quickly - manage your resources, interact with inmates and guards, and decide who you can rely on in a place where every choice has consequences.<br><br>Live the Prison Experience 👁</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the prison from a first-person perspective, observe your surroundings, interact with objects, complete daily tasks, and search for hidden items while trying to stay out of trouble.<br><br>Plan, Sneak, or Fight 🧠</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your approach to survival. Avoid attention and sneak into restricted areas to obtain contraband, or face conflicts directly in fights to earn respect. Every action shapes how others see you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Your Survival 💼</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your inventory, health, and stamina while taking part in activities, mini-games, and prison routines that can help you progress or gain small advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices and Consequences ⚖️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on missions, make deals, and break rules carefully. Getting caught can lead to punishment, stricter conditions, or solitary confinement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Life Sim 2026 - Survival, is about smart decisions, timing, and knowing when to take risks.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the unforgiving world of Prison Life Sim 2026 - Survival, where every day is a struggle and every decision can change your fate. 🔒<br><br>Behind bars, rules are strict, danger is constant, and trust is rare. You’ll need to adapt quickly - manage your resources, interact with inmates and guards, and decide who you can rely on in a place where every choice has consequences.<br><br>Live the Prison Experience 👁</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the prison from a first-person perspective, observe your surroundings, interact with objects, complete daily tasks, and search for hidden items while trying to stay out of trouble.<br><br>Plan, Sneak, or Fight 🧠</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your approach to survival. Avoid attention and sneak into restricted areas to obtain contraband, or face conflicts directly in fights to earn respect. Every action shapes how others see you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Your Survival 💼</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your inventory, health, and stamina while taking part in activities, mini-games, and prison routines that can help you progress or gain small advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices and Consequences ⚖️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on missions, make deals, and break rules carefully. Getting caught can lead to punishment, stricter conditions, or solitary confinement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Life Sim 2026 - Survival, is about smart decisions, timing, and knowing when to take risks.</p>", "short_description": "Survive the harsh reality of prison life in Prison Life Sim 2026 - Survival. Manage resources, build relationships, sneak, fight, and make choices that shape your fate in a world where every decision matters", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4413480/d7ae960e044769933062c14dc223edd49b7420d8/header.jpg?t=1785946543", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4413480/0e0b85b2e0bfab1408b5b9fcf324bd4864e33eeb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785946543", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steam